# Why Does Preflight Become Difficult With Multiple Documents?

Checking one document is one thing.

Checking a complete publication is another.

Consider:

```text
Publication/
├── Cover.indd
├── Front-Matter.indd
├── Chapter-01.indd
├── Chapter-02.indd
├── Chapter-03.indd
├── Chapter-04.indd
└── Back-Cover.indd
```

Each document may need the same production checks.

The workflow can quickly become:

```text
Open file
Check links
Check fonts
Check text
Check images
Check settings
Record problems
Close file

Open next file
Check links
Check fonts
Check text
...
```

The difficulty is not necessarily the individual check.

It is the repetition.

