# How to Preflight Multiple InDesign Documents

For a small project, checking each document using InDesign's native tools may be sufficient.

For a larger project, a batch workflow can reduce the repetitive part of the process.

A typical batch workflow is:

```text
Select project
      ↓
Analyze InDesign documents
      ↓
Run production checks
      ↓
Generate report
      ↓
Review detected issues
      ↓
Correct problems
      ↓
Perform final production review
```

This makes the project rather than the individual document the unit of verification.

